    "context": "[1] offlineRag.pdf \u00e2\u20ac\u201d 3. HR Policies > 3.1 Leave Policy\nAll full-time employees receive 28 days of paid annual leave per year, accrued monthly.\nUnused leave\nup to a maximum of 10 days may be carried over to the following calendar year.\nSick leave is separate\nand uncapped \u00e2\u20ac\u201d employees are not required to use annual leave when ill.\nParental leave: primary\ncaregivers receive 26 weeks fully paid; secondary caregivers receive 8 weeks fully paid.\nEmployees\nmust submit leave requests at least 5 business days in advance through the ZephyrHR portal.\n\n[2] offlineRag.pdf \u00e2\u20ac\u201d 3. HR Policies > 3.3 Compensation & Benefits\nBenefit Details\nStock Options Cliff vesting: 1 year, then monthly over 3 years\nAnnual Bonus Up to 20% of base salary, paid in March\nLearning Budget $1,500 USD/year per employee\nGym Allowance $60/month reimbursed via expense report\nInternet Stipend $50/month for remote-eligible employees\n\n[3] offlineRag.pdf \u00e2\u20ac\u201d 2. Product Catalog > 2.3 CloudMapper Lite\nThe paid tier, CloudMapper",
